{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/how-games-make-money-a1/audio/main-53f56ea2b2f6.mp3","durationSec":118.152,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.4,"text":"Games are fun, but they are also a business."},{"start":3.22,"end":8.26,"text":"A team works every day to make every game, and some people write code or draw pictures."},{"start":8.88,"end":11.92,"text":"Other people make music, fix problems, and help players."},{"start":12.68,"end":15.38,"text":"The company must pay these workers and make new things."},{"start":15.98,"end":19.32,"text":"A server lets people play online, and the company pays for it."},{"start":19.96,"end":22.04,"text":"Some games cost money when you buy them."},{"start":23.08,"end":24.92,"text":"Roblox and Fortnite are free to start."},{"start":25.52,"end":27.74,"text":"They need other ways to make money over time."},{"start":28.46,"end":30.96,"text":"Free games often have a shop inside the game."},{"start":30.96,"end":33.9,"text":"Players use real money to buy game money."},{"start":35.02,"end":41.1,"text":"Roblox calls its game money Robux, and Fortnite calls its game money V-Bucks."},{"start":41.1,"end":44.66,"text":"Players can buy skins, characters, coins, and other items."},{"start":45.34,"end":47.64,"text":"A skin only changes how a character looks."},{"start":49.14,"end":51.8,"text":"Fortnite also sells a Battle Pass with rewards."},{"start":52.6,"end":55.2,"text":"Some passes give players more things as they play."},{"start":55.2,"end":59.22,"text":"These things can be fun, but players do not need them to play."},{"start":59.22,"end":62.28,"text":"Games can make money from ads too."},{"start":63.08,"end":65.9,"text":"In many phone games, a player can watch a short ad."},{"start":66.5,"end":69.06,"text":"The player may get coins or an extra life."},{"start":69.58,"end":71.82,"text":"The game company gets money when people watch."},{"start":72.86,"end":75.64,"text":"Roblox can also show ads inside a game world."},{"start":76.6,"end":79.84,"text":"Games also have events with rare or limited items."},{"start":80.42,"end":83.6,"text":"These items feel special because they are not always there."},{"start":84.2,"end":87.56,"text":"Many players come back and may buy something during the event."},{"start":88.34,"end":91.54,"text":"Game companies want players to stay interested for a long time."},{"start":92.1,"end":95.58,"text":"They add new maps, characters, missions, and rewards."},{"start":96.52,"end":99.14,"text":"Fortnite often starts a new season with new things."},{"start":99.66,"end":103.22,"text":"An update can make the game feel fresh and bring many players back."},{"start":103.86,"end":107.28,"text":"A shop may say that an item is here for a short time."},{"start":107.68,"end":109.76,"text":"This can make a player want to buy it now."},{"start":110.1,"end":113.37,"text":"It is smart to stop, check the real price, and think before you buy."},{"start":113.36,"end":117.72,"text":"Buy only something you will use and can pay for."}],"words":[{"text":"Games","start":0,"end":0.24},{"text":"are","start":0.24,"end":0.44},{"text":"fun","start":0.44,"end":0.78},{"text":"but","start":1.04,"end":1.18},{"text":"they","start":1.18,"end":1.36},{"text":"are","start":1.36,"end":1.48},{"text":"also","start":1.48,"end":1.84},{"text":"a","start":1.84,"end":2.02},{"text":"business","start":2.02,"end":2.4},{"text":"A","start":3.22,"end":3.26},{"text":"team","start":3.26,"end":3.52},{"text":"works","start":3.52,"end":3.78},{"text":"every","start":3.78,"end":4.2},{"text":"day","start":4.2,"end":4.4},{"text":"to","start":4.4,"end":4.6},{"text":"make","start":4.6,"end":4.78},{"text":"every","start":4.78,"end":5.18},{"text":"game","start":5.18,"end":5.5},{"text":"and","start":6.02,"end":6.24},{"text":"some","start":6.24,"end":6.44},{"text":"people","start":6.44,"end":6.7},{"text":"write","start":6.7,"end":6.96},{"text":"code","start":6.96,"end":7.32},{"text":"or","start":7.32,"end":7.56},{